flowchart LR
  UI[Compose: Today / History / Insights / Devices] --> VM[ViewModels]
  LEGACY[Developer Lab / legacy lab screens] --> VM
  VM --> RS[RecordingService]
  RS --> SC[SessionCoordinatorImpl]
  RS --> SM[Android SensorManager]
  RS --> BLE[DeviceTransport / Android GATT]
  SM --> PIPE[SignalProcessingPipeline]
  BLE --> PIPE
  PIPE --> BUF[SensorWindowBuffer]
  BUF --> TFL[TFLite ActivityClassifier]
  SC --> ROOM[(Room v7)]
  PIPE --> SC
  TFL --> SC
  SC --> RULES[SmartRuleEngine]
  RULES --> ACT[Actuators]
  RULES --> COORD[SmartRuleEventCoordinator]
  COORD --> ROOM
  ROOM --> WM[WorkManager outbox drain]
  WM --> FB[Firebase Auth + RTDB]
